  "reason": "Existing evidence is sparse, so this experiment tests a promising multimodal setup with advanced RNA (scgpt) and image (imagenet_vit_l) encoders, transformer aggregation (which captures complex interactions), and concat fusion (a baseline for comparison). This balances exploration of key design choices (encoder complexity, aggregation) while keeping cost moderate compared to more expensive configurations like ViT + transformer with weighted fusion. The experiment clarifies whether advanced encoders and transformer aggregation are worth the cost, which are critical for multimodal performance."  
